      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for making this work. However, to me this looks very overcomplicated. I pushed a change that takes a completely different approach: https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/c/bazlets/+/596381. That change is currently breaking existing setups, but I would work on a migration path. WDYT?",
